config BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PY_LINQ
	bool "python-py-linq"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_FUTURE # runtime
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_SIX # runtime
	help
	  LINQ (Language Integrated Query) is a popular querying
	  language available in .NET. This library ports the language
	  so that developers can query collections of objects using
	  the same syntax. This library would be useful for Python
	  developers with experience using the expressiveness and
	  power of LINQ.

	  https://github.com/viralogic/py-enumerable
